<h1 id="preface">Preface</h1>

<p>In iOS 11, Apple made a change that drew the attention of many developers</p>

<p><strong>Unique identifiers such as UDID stored in the system keychain are deleted when the app is uninstalled</strong></p>

<p>This issue has been debated on Weibo for days</p>

