<h3 id="final-solution">Final solution</h3>

<ol>
  <li>For versions before iOS 11, temporarily keep using approaches like UUID stored in the keychain</li>
  <li>For iOS 11, try to adopt the new API to adapt and solve the problem</li>
</ol>

<p>For the server, you can treat the token as a new associated field — for example, how many devices are logged in under one account</p>

<p>Then, under one UID, you would attach the iOS version + token</p>

<p>I believe that before long, a mature token-based solution will stand out</p>

